      809        SIZE 98 BY 2.19 NO-UNDO.
      810   DEFINE VARIABLE filt-1 AS CHARACTER FORMAT "X(256)":U
      811        VIEW-AS FILL-IN
      812        SIZE 19 BY .95 NO-UNDO.
