     1907         :
     1908           if p-change-value > 0
     1909           then do:
     1910             for each buf_temp-diasize-handle
     1911             on error undo, next
     1912             :
     1913               assign
     1914                 v-object-handle = buf_temp-diasize-handle.handle-value
     1915               .
     1916               if v-object-handle <> v-diasize-resize-button
     1917               then do:
     1918                 assign
     1919                   v-object-handle :col = buf_temp-diasize-handle.save-position
     1920                 .
     1921               end.
